{"kind":"request","text":"CLI-1: `dap act` crashes on a nested @handle in a list field.\n\nFiled per ruling d4a5e76f, from the FW-1 run on hakuin.local (main 4e5d6c87).\n\nRed (observed 22:07Z, Counter 0.3.0 scope, founder home of a host-none base room):\n  dap act commit --on \u003ccounter scope\u003e --set 'basis=[{\"id\":3,\"member\":\"@owner\"}]' --set generation=0 --set n=1 --set participant=3 --set serial=1\nResult: Node exits with an uncaught FieldShapeError and a stack trace:\n  \"fields.basis.0.member is not a member reference\" (packages/client/src/declared-shape.ts:43, from shapeDeclaredAct, declared.ts:95).\nThe same act with a full member reference ({\"member\":\"@owner\",\"membership\":{genesis,scope}}) took effect at entry 6.\n\nTwo faults:\n1. Resolution. `valueOf` (packages/cli/src/browser-helpers.ts:30-41) turns \"@handle\" into a member reference only for a top-level member field, and only when `config.repository` is set. A list or record holding a member is parsed as raw JSON, so its \"@handle\" stays a string. docs/cli.md (dap act) says \"`@handle` is a member of this room\" and \"a list or a record is JSON\".\n2. Report. A field-shape fault before signing escapes as an uncaught exception. Every other pre-signing refusal prints one line and exits 1.\n\nOutcome: a nested @handle in a list or record resolves to this room's member, or the command refuses with one line and exit 1 before signing. In both cases no stack trace appears. Reds: the command above, as a CLI test against a scope with a list-of-records member field. Decide in the head whether a host-none room (no repository) resolves @handle from the room's membership.","body":{"conditions":"A CLI test reproduces the crash on main, then passes: nested @handle resolves or refuses with one line and exit 1, never an uncaught exception. docs/cli.md says which.","target_head":"4e5d6c87a6369f3b5e64b1c6a05d1cf97159d6ec","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3","to":"20db43a245e9780b92a587425d387d393b17ffc90b89e036ff752399f88fc517"}}